  m_Name: Cap2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  partName: Cap
  description: The Cap is a tiny, elongated component positioned at the middle-front
    center of the jet engine, which provides a secure seal around the engine's shaft.
    Its compact design enables the engine to maintain optimal performance while minimizing
    the risk of damage from external factors. Interestingly, the Cap is designed
    to be easily removable, allowing for convenient maintenance and inspection of
    the shaft and surrounding components.
